OL,3,GNEWSAReservoirs get boost but
OL,4,Awater-saving plea remains
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorms Austen and Boelo gave Guernsey
OL,7,Freservoirs a short-lived boost, but
OL,8,Fislanders are still being urged to save
OL,9,Fwater as winter begins.
OL,11,FThe storms delivered the first increase
OL,12,Fin reservoir levels since June, adding
OL,13,F100 million litres, said Guernsey
OL,14,FWater.
OL,16,FBut it pointed out that reservoirs were
OL,17,Fstill only 70% full, about 2% below the
OL,18,Flevel recorded at the same time last
OL,19,Fyear, 6% below the five-year average
OL,20,Fand 10% below the decade average.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
