OL,3,GNEWSAReservoirs get boost but
OL,4,Awater-saving plea remains
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey Water operations manager Jon
OL,7,FHolt said the recent rain had nudged
OL,8,Fstorage levels in the right direction,
OL,9,Fbut warned "a couple of wet days cannot
OL,10,Fdo the whole job and downpours don't
OL,11,Fend droughts".
